**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
.git/
.gitignore
Dockerfile
.dockerignore

# Locally uploaded task/chat attachments and avatars. These are REAL user files: the Dockerfile
# does `COPY src/ src/`, so without this line they are baked into every image built from a
# developer machine and travel wherever that image goes. .gitignore already excludes them from
# the repository — this is the equivalent protection for the build context.
src/Nexus.Web/App_Data/uploads/

# Local docker-compose secrets. Never COPYed today, but it has no business being in the build
# context at all — a future `COPY . .` would silently put the Postgres password in a layer.
.env

# Design reference screenshots dropped in the project root; nothing to do with the image.
*.PNG
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
Wireframes/
docs/
